<title>GEORGIA: Georgian October inflation slows to 0.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Georgian October inflation slows to 0.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TBILISI 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Georgia's monthly consumer price inflation was 0.4 percent in October after 0.5 percent in September, the Department for Social and Economic Information said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    GEORGIAN CONSUMER PRICES   OCT 96    SEP 96    OCT 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	  +0.4	+0.5     +23.4</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	   +15.4     +41.8    +141.9</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
